    "dynamic_instructions": "{\r\n  \"results\": \"**Model: Rangers by Day**\\n\\nThis model was not trained on your photos. Read its data card.\\n- Who collected it: park rangers on day patrols\\n- When: mornings and afternoons, wet and dry seasons\\n- Records: 100\\n\\n**Enter these three cases:**\\n- Case 1: Season Dry, Time of Day Night, Water Level Low, Temperature Cool\\n- Case 2: Season Wet, Time of Day Morning, Water Level High, Temperature Cool\\n- Case 3: Season Wet, Time of Day Afternoon, Water Level Low, Temperature Hot\\n\\n**Steps**\\n- In the **Make a prediction** panel, use the menus to enter Case 1. Click **Predict**.\\n- Do the same for Case 2 and Case 3.\\n- If a menu has no category you need, write \\\"can't enter\\\" in your guide.\\n- Write each prediction next to Rangers by Day in your guide.\\n- You're done when all three cases have a prediction or \\\"can't enter.\\\"\\n\\n<table style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 10px;\\\">\\n  <tr><td colspan=\\\"2\\\" style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 3px 6px; background: #eee; color: #000; text-align: center;\\\"><strong>Case 1</strong></td></tr>\\n  <tr><td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 3px 6px; white-space: nowrap;\\\">Season</td><td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 3px 6px; white-space: nowrap;\\\">Dry</td></tr>\\n  <tr><td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 3px 6px; white-space: nowrap;\\\">Time of Day</td><td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 3px 6px; white-space: nowrap;\\\">Night</td></tr>\\n  <tr><td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 3px 6px; white-space: nowrap;\\\">Water Level</td><td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 3px 6px; white-space: nowrap;\\\">Low</td></tr>\\n  <tr><td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 3px 6px; white-space: nowrap;\\\">Temperature</td><td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 3px 6px; white-space: nowrap;\\\">Cool</td></tr>\\n</table>\\n\\n<table style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 10px;\\\">\\n  <tr><td colspan=\\\"2\\\" style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 3px 6px; background: #eee; color: #000; text-align: center;\\\"><strong>Case 2</strong></td></tr>\\n  <tr><td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 3px 6px; white-space: nowrap;\\\">Season</td><td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 3px 6px; white-space: nowrap;\\\">Wet</td></tr>\\n  <tr><td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 3px 6px; white-space: nowrap;\\\">Time of Day</td><td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 3px 6px; white-space: nowrap;\\\">Morning</td></tr>\\n  <tr><td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 3px 6px; white-space: nowrap;\\\">Water Level</td><td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 3px 6px; white-space: nowrap;\\\">High</td></tr>\\n  <tr><td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 3px 6px; white-space: nowrap;\\\">Temperature</td><td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 3px 6px; white-space: nowrap;\\\">Cool</td></tr>\\n</table>\\n\\n<table style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 10px;\\\">\\n  <tr><td colspan=\\\"2\\\" style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 3px 6px; background: #eee; color: #000; text-align: center;\\\"><strong>Case 3</strong></td></tr>\\n  <tr><td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 3px 6px; white-space: nowrap;\\\">Season</td><td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 3px 6px; white-space: nowrap;\\\">Wet</td></tr>\\n  <tr><td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 3px 6px; white-space: nowrap;\\\">Time of Day</td><td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 3px 6px; white-space: nowrap;\\\">Afternoon</td></tr>\\n  <tr><td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 3px 6px; white-space: nowrap;\\\">Water Level</td><td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 3px 6px; white-space: nowrap;\\\">Low</td></tr>\\n  <tr><td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 3px 6px; white-space: nowrap;\\\">Temperature</td><td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 3px 6px; white-space: nowrap;\\\">Hot</td></tr>\\n</table>\\n\\n<table style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 12px;\\\">\\n  <tr>\\n    <th style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 4px 8px; text-align: left;\\\">Feature</th>\\n    <th style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 4px 8px; text-align: left;\\\">Case 1</th>\\n    <th style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 4px 8px; text-align: left;\\\">Case 2</th>\\n    <th style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 4px 8px; text-align: left;\\\">Case 3</th>\\n  </tr>\\n  <tr>\\n    <td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 4px 8px;\\\">Season</td>\\n    <td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 4px 8px;\\\">Dry</td>\\n    <td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 4px 8px;\\\">Wet</td>\\n    <td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 4px 8px;\\\">Wet</td>\\n  </tr>\\n  <tr>\\n    <td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 4px 8px;\\\">Time of Day</td>\\n    <td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 4px 8px;\\\">Night</td>\\n    <td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 4px 8px;\\\">Morning</td>\\n    <td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 4px 8px;\\\">Afternoon</td>\\n  </tr>\\n  <tr>\\n    <td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 4px 8px;\\\">Water Level</td>\\n    <td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 4px 8px;\\\">Low</td>\\n    <td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 4px 8px;\\\">High</td>\\n    <td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 4px 8px;\\\">Low</td>\\n  </tr>\\n  <tr>\\n    <td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 4px 8px;\\\">Temperature</td>\\n    <td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 4px 8px;\\\">Cool</td>\\n    <td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 4px 8px;\\\">Cool</td>\\n    <td style=\\\"border: 1px solid #999; padding: 4px 8px;\\\">Hot</td>\\n  </tr>\\n</table>\"\r\n}"
